WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The task: pick, hand over, place

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.167
01  Pick up the clamp

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:09.334
02  Find a reachable transfer pose

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:18.333
03  Close the receiving gripper

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:20.833
04  Observe before releasing

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:26.833
05  Release the giving arm

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:29.500
06  Retreat after the transfer

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.500
07  Carry to the blue bin

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.667
08  Place and return home

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:39.667
Result: completed handover and placement

